WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.209
Observational medical data arise from the
interaction between patients and the healthcare system.

00:00:06.289 --> 00:00:08.219
When a clinician orders a test,

00:00:08.299 --> 00:00:12.433
its timing and its existence carry information
about the patient.

00:00:12.513 --> 00:00:16.453
Most models ignore this, assuming sampling is
non-informative.

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:21.121
Ignoring clinical presence yields sub-optimal,
non-transportable models;

00:00:21.201 --> 00:00:23.390
modelling it explicitly is the fix.
